# Archon Web UI password gate — imported by both Caddyfiles.
#
# This file is EMPTY by default, which means NO PASSWORD is required.
# Generate a real gate (never hand-edit this file):
#
#     ./archon password 'your-password-here'      # macOS / Linux / Git Bash
#     .\archon.ps1 password 'your-password-here'  # Windows PowerShell
#
# That writes a bcrypt hash below. A hash is not a plaintext password, but it
# is still a credential — do not publish this file.
